OL,3,GNEWSASaints drop plan for memorial wall
OL,4,Afor fans' ashes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan for a memorial wall that would
OL,7,Fhave included the ashes of Northampton
OL,8,FSaints rugby fans has been cancelled.
OL,10,FThe Saints Memorial Wall was to have
OL,11,Fbeen part of a wider development to
OL,12,Fenhance the fan village at the Prem
OL,13,FRugby side's Franklin's Gardens ground.
OL,15,FHowever, the club said initial demand
OL,16,F"was not sufficient to support the
OL,17,Flong-term viability of the
OL,18,Fdevelopment".
OL,20,FSupporters who have already paid will
OL,21,Freceive a refund, Saints said.
